    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">The transactions reported herein reflect a one-time stock option repricing (the &quot;Option Repricing&quot;) effective on November 12, 2026 (the &quot;Effective Date&quot;). The Option Repricing applies to options with exercise prices equal to $12.88 per share (the &quot;Original Exercise Price&quot;) held by the reporting person as of the Effective Date. Each stock option at the Original Exercise Price was amended such that the exercise price is now $5.31.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">Represents a right to receive an option for one ordinary share of the Issuer, par value $0.001 per share (&quot;Ordinary Shares&quot;). The Ordinary Shares underlying the options vest, if at all, based on the achievement of a certain volume weighted average price per Ordinary Share for any trailing twenty (20) consecutive trading days (&quot;VWAP&quot;) beginning on or after November 28, 2025, as determined, approved and certified by the Compensation Committee of the Board of Directors. Pursuant to the Option Repricing, the options will vest upon satisfaction of the following thresholds: 1/3rd upon the achievement of a $6.65 VWAP through October 31, 2026, 1/3rd upon the achievement of a $8.30 VWAP through October 31, 2027, and 1/3rd upon the achievement of a $10.37 VWAP through October 31, 2028. Any tranche of options that has not vested by the last day of the applicable period shall automatically terminate.</footnote>
